  <item>
    <title>EP51 聊聊朋友啊：怎么好的，怎么又散了？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d4fd36e2c8be3155995cb5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d4fd36e2c8be3155995cb5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Apr 2026 16:04:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期聊聊朋友和友情里的“聚”和“散”。</span></p><p><span>引发思考的起因是一次久违的重逢——</span><br><span>当我和一个认识二十多年的发小第一次密集相处，突然意识到一个残酷的现实：我们对互相的认识，很可能就停在了20年前...</span><br><br><br><strong><em><span>本期音乐：ARAI - Pink Palms</span></em></strong></p><p><strong><em><span>本期内容：</span></em></strong><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">00:04:46</a></span></strong><span> 朋友：对自我确认的支撑</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="629">00:10:29</a></span></strong><span> 为了不显得孤单而交友</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">00:13:20</a></span></strong><span> 女生友谊的复杂</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">00:20:28</a></span></strong><span> 男生友谊的脆弱</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">00:24:12</a></span></strong><span> 对朋友的占有欲</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">00:38:42</a></span></strong><span> 忘年交</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2512">00:41:52</a></span></strong><span> 友谊是唯一平等的关系</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2673">00:44:33</a></span></strong><span> 友谊的理想样本</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3267">00:54:27</a></span></strong><span> 走散的几种可能情况</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4039">01:07:19</a></span></strong><span> 远距离：天涯若比邻是骗人的</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4311">01:11:51</a></span></strong><span> 流行文化只劝分</span><br><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4458">01:14:18</a></span></strong><span> 厌恶“搭子”，厌恶浮皮潦草的关系</span><br></p><p><span>👋欢迎大家在苹果播客/豆瓣/网易云/QQ音乐搜索“Thoughts on Hold不许联想” 以及通过微信视频号《播客不许联想》关注我们。</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi4gZFVy5VMnnjy-nKQrIKu-hVSd.jpg"></figure><p><br><br><br></p>]]></description>
