    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Mar 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><span>我觉得有一只龙虾🦞正在疯狂袭击我...</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>春晚机器人上场，全民排队部署Open Claw，我妈开始日更AI短视频。我感到我的实际需求已经跟不上AI发展的速度，这让人有种不赶趟儿的焦虑。于是我们妄聊一期AI话题。另外，由于我们并不是AI工具的一线使用者，所以非常欢迎大家不吝就相关问题指点迷津。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>本期音乐：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>窦唯&amp;译乐队 - 《旺天下》</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="233">00:03:53</a></span></strong><span> 近期AI使用实例：健身、澳网、旅游、助理</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1261">00:21:01</a></span></strong><span> 潮流追赶和依赖分层：功能性依赖、习惯性依赖、机构化依赖</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1607">00:26:47</a></span></strong><span> 战争责任、伦理和恐惧：是谁在伊朗发射导弹？美军还是AI</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2212">00:36:52</a></span></strong><span> 北洋海军：先进战舰、落后制度、人</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2333">00:38:53</a></span></strong><span> AI和李叔同：创作者的AI羞耻和AI版权</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3139">00:52:19</a></span></strong><span> 垃圾进垃圾出：如果以后AI只吃自己吐出来的</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3295">00:54:55</a></span></strong><span> 对大学的冲击：学科裁撤、中世纪神学如何对接AI</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3814">01:03:34</a></span></strong><span> AI给老师留下的全是脏活累活</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3849">01:04:09</a></span></strong><span> 如何认识AI取决于如何认识自己</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>👋欢迎大家在苹果播客/豆瓣/网易云/QQ音乐搜索“Thoughts on Hold不许联想” 以及通过微信视频号《播客不许联想》关注我们</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlVlIxvujwGzxiiL5BOnbLdO5ccp.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
